note Riptide (tier III): ratios 2, 3, 1, 5, 6, 4 -> root, fifth, third: the droplets gather onto a major chord, the surface runs fast and
note bright (stretched 1.3x), the bubbling loop races with the pen's speed, a rock splash on lock. All surface, no depth.

